#!golden 1
#!case cmd_i2c
#!section exit
0
#!section stdout
#!section stderr
usage: i2c [bus=public|# [chan=#] <i2caddr> <read bytes> [write data]
            bus=public is default
            chan=0 is default, bus= must be specified to use chan=
            i2caddr is an 8-bit I2C address, only even numbers are accepted
#!section requests
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=00
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=03
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
bye
